commit 3a2484ccf5b766cf8a9b371f06dcdaf3101f8b13
Author: Jessie Yang <jiaxiyan@amazon.com>
Date:   Mon Oct 5 17:09:42 2026 -0700

    core: Change flush return type to int and update man page
    
    ssize_t encodes a transfer size, but flush has nothing to size.
    Also clarify that fi_flush failures are considered fatal.
    
    Signed-off-by: Jessie Yang <jiaxiyan@amazon.com>

